    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Technology partners provide infrastructure or technology enablement or marketplace for us to build, deploy and market Jivrus' products. Typically the technology partners have well established platform on which users need our products/ solutions. Example: Google, Zoho, Microsoft, AWS",
